 ## Background
-VTC was proposed in "Visibility-Aware Texture Consensus and Local Structural Constraints for 3D Gaussian Reconstruction in Texture-Degraded Scenes" [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the identifiability of geometric supervision under texture degradation. The method is based on the hypothesis that weakly textured regions and foreground-background mixed boundaries reduce the identifiability of photometric gradients with respect to geometric parameters [S1, unofficial].
